OL,3,AMexican drug lord on FBI's 10 most
OL,4,Awanted list arrested in shoot-out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Mexican drug lord who was on the
OL,7,FFBI's 10 most wanted list has been
OL,8,Farrested following a shoot-out with
OL,9,FMexican authorities.
OL,11,FFausto Isidro "Chapo Isidro" Meza
OL,12,FFlores was detained along with his
OL,13,Flieutenant by Mexican special forces in
OL,14,FGuasave, Sinaloa on Friday, Mexico's
OL,15,Fdefence secretariat said.
OL,17,FMeza Flores was wanted in Mexico on
OL,18,Forganised crime charges, while he has
OL,19,Fbeen accused of "flooding the US with
OL,20,Ffentanyl, cocaine, heroin and other
OL,21,Fdeadly drugs" by the FBI. The US is
OL,22,Fseeking his extradition.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
